@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+# CONTRACT: Full-Text Search Feature
+
+## Search endpoint `GET /notes/search?q=<query>`
+- [ ] Returns matching notes for keyword → test: `?q=python` returns results.length > 0
+- [ ] Results have string `snippet` field → test: results[0].snippet is string
+- [ ] Snippets contain `<mark>`/`</mark>` around matches → test: snippet contains both tags
+- [ ] Ranked by relevance (rank ascending = most relevant first) → test: rank[i] >= rank[i-1]
+- [ ] Quoted phrase support → test: `?q="chocolate chip"` matches chocolate note
+- [ ] Each result has id(number), title(string), snippet(string), rank(number) → test: typeof checks
+- [ ] Nonexistent term returns empty array → test: `?q=xyznonexistentterm` => results == []
+- [ ] Missing q returns 400 → test: `/notes/search` => 400
+- [ ] Empty q returns 400 → test: `?q=` => 400
+- [ ] Pagination: 20 per page, page=1 => <=20 results, page=1, perPage=20
+- [ ] Pagination page=2 => page==2, results is array
+- [ ] Response has numeric `total` > 0 for matches
+- [ ] Special chars don't crash → test: &, ', <script>, +, /, space => 200 + array
+
+## Suggest endpoint `GET /notes/search/suggest?q=<prefix>`
+- [ ] Up to 5 titles, prefix match against content → test: `?q=learn` => 0<len<=5
+- [ ] Prefix matches title → test: `?q=getting` includes "Getting Started..."
+- [ ] Empty q returns 400 → test: `?q=` => 400
+- [ ] Response format `{ results: SuggestResult[] }`
+
+## FTS sync
+- [ ] Create syncs → new note searchable
+- [ ] Update syncs → new content found, old not found
+- [ ] Delete syncs → note removed from search
+
+## Regression
+- [ ] All 15 existing CRUD tests still pass
+- [ ] Search response < 100ms for seeded dataset
+- [ ] Build clean (tsc), lint clean (eslint)
